/P 306 0 R
/E ("SMB adoption of AI still trails the enterprise, but criminal adoption hasn't waited," said Jim Griffith, CEO of Corporate Technologies. "Phishing, smishing, and social engineering have become materially harder for individuals to detect, which means a company's resilience can no longer depend on any single layer. The network, the employees, and the core applications all have to hold." )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
