/E (Backup automation \(71%\) and offsite or cloud replication \(60%\) remain well above industry averages. Documented RPO/RTO targets and 90-day tested restores remain at 5% each, unchanged from the prior edition and still the widest gap in the index. The external context deteriorated. Veeam's 2026 research finds only 28% of ransomware victims fully restore their data, and Semperis' 2025 study found just 23% of victims recover within a day, down from 39% a year earlier.)
/Pg 14 0 R
