/P 311 0 R
/E (Q1 reported 12,977 blocked ransomware attempts as a single count. The Q2 instrumentation does not produce an equivalent single number; it produces a funnel \(Section 4c\), which is both more informative and more honest about what automated defenses actually do. The single count is retired. )
/Pg 18 0 R
