/E ("The uncomfortable part of instrumenting everything is that the numbers get worse before they get better," said Ben Silver, Chief Operating Officer. "A device-level patch assessment will always read lower than a policy roll-up. We publish the stricter number because that's the one an attacker interacts with.")
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
574 0 obj
<<
