/P 317 0 R
/E (MSP360's 2025 survey of managed service providers adds a stark continuity dimension: nearly 88% of MSP client organizations could stay operational for less than a week after a major disruption, and half could last only a single day. )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
