/P 318 0 R
/E (Between the 2024 and 2026 research cycles, full-restore rates after ransomware fell to 28%, same-day recovery nearly halved, and repository-targeting became standard attacker practice, while immutable backup adoption industry-wide sits at 32%, and at 11% within this client base. The gap has not widened on paper, but the cost of falling into it has. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
