/E (Against the Freshservice benchmark's 21.96-hour cross-industry average, the like-for-like figure is the blended 39.0-hour mean, and on that comparison the managed desk reads slower. The composition explains why. The internal figure spans every automated monitoring and security alert alongside human-initiated requests, including a long tail of scheduled, multi-visit, and after-hours work. The priority breakdown is the more informative read \(critical issues resolved in an average of 8.5 hours, P2 issues in 11.4\), and the 11-minute median on application-control approvals points the same direction. When something is urgent, the response is fast. Both readings are reported; neither is curated away. )
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [3]
>>
