/E (The most instructive deltas in this edition are definitional. A device-level patch assessment reads 65.3% where a legacy roll-up read 94%. A quarter-scoped detection pipeline verifies 215 incidents where an escalation count logged 379. There is no evidence the environment changed that much in six months; the instruments demonstrably did. The practical lesson for SMB leaders is to ask, of every reassuring metric an IT provider reports, what standard it is measured against. )
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [0]
