/E (Two consecutive editions show RPO/RTO documentation and tested restores at 5%, unmoved through six months of otherwise stable operations. Nothing in day-to-day IT operations naturally generates recovery discipline; no successful backup job prompts a restore test. Meanwhile full recovery after ransomware fell to 28% industry-wide, and same-day recovery nearly halved. )
