859 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 332 0 R
/E ("The reliance on technology for SMB success is only going to increase, and consumer expectations have already gone 24/7," said Jim Griffith, CEO of Corporate Technologies. "A service issue that could wait until tomorrow morning a decade ago now costs you the customer tonight. Choosing an IT partner with the scale, redundancy, and operational discipline to deliver around the clock is becoming a differentiator, not a luxury.")
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
