/E (Draft or update a formal incident response plan with defined roles, escalation paths, communication procedures, and specific steps for the first hour, first four hours, and first 24 hours. The payoff is now quantified; 80% of SMBs with formal plans avoided major attack damage. A plan that exists only as a vague intention to "call IT" is not a plan. )
/Pg 46 0 R
/K [2 1209 0 R 4]
>>
