/P 339 0 R
/E (Then review cyber insurance against actual security posture. The market is the softest it has been in three years, with rates down for twelve consecutive quarters, but carriers underwrite on documented controls. Verify that MFA documentation, backup verification records, and access-control evidence meet the insurer's specific requirements for claim eligibility, before an incident makes the question urgent. )
/Pg 46 0 R
/K [5]
>>
