/Title (Most SMBs in this index operate between Tier 1 and Tier 2. The internal data shows strong performance on automation, detection, and response speed, but persistent gaps in recovery documentation, immutable backup coverage, and universal MFA deployment. Closing those gaps is the path from Tier 1 to Tier 3, and with two editions of trend data now in hand it is measurable quarter over quarter.)
